  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/More_Beautiful_Torches/BH_More_Beautiful_Torches_Header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2091\" height=\"861\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">《更美的火把》旨在提升遊戲的裝飾可能性，目前新增超過600種火把變體，未來期望能為遊戲中每個元素都推出主題變體。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要與朋友同樂的伺服器嗎？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/More_Beautiful_Torches/BH_More_Beautiful_Torches_Promo.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"388\"></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">若您正在尋找能與朋友遊玩任何模組或模組包的伺服器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong>正是您的首選！他們提供性價比最高的Minecraft伺服器，點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>並使用代碼「Lupin」即可享75折優惠。</span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/More_Beautiful_Torches/BH_More_Beautiful_Torches_Summary.webp\" width=\"2091\" height=\"375\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">本模組新增超過600種火把，皆可使用原版材料合成，沒錯，您幾乎能用任何材料製作火把...</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">這將帶來豐富的裝飾可能性，非常適合用來裝飾各種建築，遊戲中每個方塊都將擁有專屬的火把變體！雖然許多其他元素也已具備變體，且三個版本皆可適用。</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjason13official\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/860325/description_e69745c8-b22d-4d0d-a55e-5c131ae1fe50.webp\" alt=\"Jason13 Ko-Fi\" width=\"286\" height=\"73\"></span></span></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/More_Beautiful_Torches/BH_More_Beautiful_Torches_FAQ.webp\" width=\"2091\" height=\"376\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>是否與其他會修改火把的模組相容？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">我們已盡力確保與所有Minecraft模組相容，舉例來說，若安裝「Danger Close」，本模組也能完美相容。此外，您可要求額外相容性，我們將著手處理。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>可在伺服器上運作嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然！運作完全正常！請記住，與朋友遊玩模組的最佳方式是透過BisectHosting，且<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>點擊此連結可享75折優惠</strong></a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此模組可用於模組包嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！但僅限發布於Modrinth或CurseForge。上傳至其他平台將侵犯我們的權利，絕不允許。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">然而，若您考慮將本模組加入您的Modrinth或CurseForge模組包，我們將不勝感激。如需任何微調或有疑問，請聯絡我們！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可否錄製此模組的影片並在頻道上展示？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然，您可自由在頻道上遊玩此模組或我們的任何模組包並製作影片，事實上，我們將對此深表感謝！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/More_Beautiful_Torches/BH_More_Beautiful_Torches_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"2091\" height=\"376\"></strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/694/71/more-beautiful-torches.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2091\" height=\"1176\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/694/72/more-beautiful-torches-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2091\" height=\"1176\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/694/73/more-beautiful-torches-3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2091\" height=\"1176\"></p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RCLAzuJ2tME?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></p>",
